{% doc %}
  Full-width About page for Moon Apparel (Careers-style layout).
{% enddoc %}

{% render 'msa-brand-page-styles' %}

<div class="section moon-bp" style="--section-pt: 0; --section-pb: 0;">
  <section class="moon-bp__hero">
    <div class="moon-bp__hero-media">
      <img
        src="{{ 'moon-page-store.jpg' | asset_url }}"
        alt="Moon Apparel clothing and store atmosphere"
        loading="eager"
        width="1600"
        height="900"
      >
      <div class="moon-bp__hero-overlay"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="moon-bp__hero-content fluid_container">
      <p class="moon-bp__eyebrow">Est. 2012 — UK based</p>
      <h1 class="moon-bp__hero-title">About Moon Apparel</h1>
      <p class="moon-bp__hero-text">
        Established in 2012, Moon Apparel is a UK-based online fashion retailer dedicated to delivering
        stylish, comfortable, and high-quality clothing for everyday living.
      </p>
      <a href="/collections/all" class="moon-bp__btn moon-bp__btn--light">Shop collections</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="moon-bp__section fluid_container">
    <div class="moon-bp__prose">
      <p>We believe fashion should be accessible, responsibly made, and designed to inspire confidence in every customer.</p>
      <p>From wardrobe essentials to seasonal favourites, our collections combine timeless style with modern trends, offering versatile pieces for every occasion.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="moon-bp__section moon-bp__section--soft">
    <div class="fluid_container">
      <div class="moon-bp__split moon-bp__split--reverse">
        <div class="moon-bp__split-media">
          <img src="{{ 'moon-page-design.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Designing Moon Apparel collections" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600">
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="moon-bp__heading">Our story</h2>
          <div class="moon-bp__prose">
            <p>Moon Apparel was founded with a simple vision: to create clothing that looks great, feels comfortable, and offers exceptional value without compromising on quality or responsibility.</p>
            <p>Over the years, we have built long-term relationships with trusted manufacturing partners and suppliers, allowing us to maintain consistent quality while continually expanding our collections.</p>
            <p>Whether you're shopping for everyday basics, statement pieces, or seasonal essentials, our goal is to provide clothing you'll enjoy wearing for years to come.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="moon-bp__section fluid_container">
    <div class="moon-bp__split">
      <div class="moon-bp__split-media">
        <img src="{{ 'moon-page-manufacturing.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Moon Apparel manufacturing quality" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600">
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="moon-bp__heading">Our manufacturing</h2>
        <div class="moon-bp__prose">
          <p>Quality begins long before a product reaches our customers. Our garments are produced through our experienced manufacturing partner, <strong>Moon Style Textile</strong>, where skilled teams combine modern production techniques with strict quality control standards.</p>
          <p>By working closely with our manufacturing operations, we maintain greater control over product quality, ethical production, and customer satisfaction.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="moon-bp__section moon-bp__section--soft">
    <div class="fluid_container">
      <div class="moon-bp__section-head">
        <h2 class="moon-bp__heading">Designed with quality in mind</h2>
        <p class="moon-bp__lead">Every garment is carefully selected and produced with attention to detail, comfort, and durability.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="moon-bp__cards moon-bp__cards--4">
        <div class="moon-bp__card"><h3 class="moon-bp__card-title">Tops</h3><p class="moon-bp__card-text">T-shirts, graphic tees, camis, tanks, polos, and button-front shirts.</p></div>
        <div class="moon-bp__card"><h3 class="moon-bp__card-title">Layers</h3><p class="moon-bp__card-text">Hoodies, sweatshirts, sweaters, cardigans, jackets, and coats.</p></div>
        <div class="moon-bp__card"><h3 class="moon-bp__card-title">Bottoms</h3><p class="moon-bp__card-text">Jeans, trousers, shorts, and sweatpants for everyday wear.</p></div>
        <div class="moon-bp__card"><h3 class="moon-bp__card-title">New &amp; seasonal</h3><p class="moon-bp__card-text">Fresh arrivals and seasonal collections updated regularly.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="moon-bp__section moon-bp__section--soft">
    <div class="fluid_container">
      <div class="moon-bp__section-head">
        <h2 class="moon-bp__heading">Sustainability</h2>
        <p class="moon-bp__lead">
          The future of fashion depends on responsible choices. Sustainability is an ongoing journey —
          and we continue to improve our practices across every part of the business.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="moon-bp__cards">
        <a class="moon-bp__card" href="/pages/organic-cotton">
          <span class="moon-bp__card-label">Materials</span>
          <h3 class="moon-bp__card-title">Organic cotton</h3>
          <p class="moon-bp__card-text">Naturally soft fabrics grown with healthier farming practices.</p>
          <span class="moon-bp__card-cta">Learn more</span>
        </a>
        <a class="moon-bp__card" href="/pages/recycled-polyester">
          <span class="moon-bp__card-label">Materials</span>
          <h3 class="moon-bp__card-title">Recycled polyester</h3>
          <p class="moon-bp__card-text">Giving existing materials a second life.</p>
          <span class="moon-bp__card-cta">Learn more</span>
        </a>
        <a class="moon-bp__card" href="/pages/responsible-sourcing">
          <span class="moon-bp__card-label">Supply</span>
          <h3 class="moon-bp__card-title">Responsible sourcing</h3>
          <p class="moon-bp__card-text">Partners who share our ethical production standards.</p>
          <span class="moon-bp__card-cta">Learn more</span>
        </a>
        <a class="moon-bp__card" href="/pages/less-waste">
          <span class="moon-bp__card-label">Planet</span>
          <h3 class="moon-bp__card-title">Less waste</h3>
          <p class="moon-bp__card-text">Smarter production and packaging choices.</p>
          <span class="moon-bp__card-cta">Learn more</span>
        </a>
        <a class="moon-bp__card" href="/pages/ethics">
          <span class="moon-bp__card-label">Standards</span>
          <h3 class="moon-bp__card-title">Ethics</h3>
          <p class="moon-bp__card-text">Respect, fairness, and integrity in every decision.</p>
          <span class="moon-bp__card-cta">Learn more</span>
        </a>
        <a class="moon-bp__card" href="/pages/commitment">
          <span class="moon-bp__card-label">Community</span>
          <h3 class="moon-bp__card-title">Commitment</h3>
          <p class="moon-bp__card-text">Charitable partner SAVE DC and impact beyond fashion.</p>
          <span class="moon-bp__card-cta">Learn more</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="moon-bp__highlight">
    <div class="fluid_container moon-bp__highlight-inner">
      <p class="moon-bp__eyebrow moon-bp__eyebrow--light">Our commitment</p>
      <h2 class="moon-bp__heading moon-bp__heading--light">Charitable partner — SAVE DC</h2>
      <div class="moon-bp__highlight-text">
        <p>At Moon Apparel, we believe businesses should create a positive impact beyond fashion. We are proud to support <strong>SAVE DC</strong>, an organisation dedicated to transforming lives through education.</p>
        <p>By partnering with SAVE DC, we contribute to initiatives that expand educational opportunities and help communities build a stronger future.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/pages/commitment" class="moon-bp__btn moon-bp__btn--light">Read our commitment</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="moon-bp__section fluid_container">
    <div class="moon-bp__section-head">
      <h2 class="moon-bp__heading">Why choose Moon Apparel?</h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="moon-bp__checklist">
      <li class="moon-bp__check-item"><span class="moon-bp__check-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Established in 2012</span></li>
      <li class="moon-bp__check-item"><span class="moon-bp__check-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>UK-based online fashion retailer</span></li>
      <li class="moon-bp__check-item"><span class="moon-bp__check-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>High-quality garments at competitive prices</span></li>
      <li class="moon-bp__check-item"><span class="moon-bp__check-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Trusted manufacturing expertise</span></li>
      <li class="moon-bp__check-item"><span class="moon-bp__check-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Ethical and responsible sourcing</span></li>
      <li class="moon-bp__check-item"><span class="moon-bp__check-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Proud supporter of SAVE DC education initiatives</span></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="moon-bp__cta">
    <div class="fluid_container moon-bp__cta-inner">
      <h2 class="moon-bp__heading moon-bp__heading--light">Looking ahead</h2>
      <p class="moon-bp__lead moon-bp__lead--light">
        Thank you for choosing Moon Apparel. We're proud to be part of your wardrobe and look forward to serving you for many years to come.
      </p>
      <a href="/pages/beliefs" class="moon-bp__btn moon-bp__btn--light">Explore our beliefs</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
